# Prettier ignores. The lefthook pre-commit `format` job globs *.yaml, which
# would otherwise let Prettier reformat tool-generated lockfiles.

# pnpm and Prettier disagree on YAML style (flow vs. block mappings, trailing
# commas, quoting). Letting the hook reformat pnpm-lock.yaml produces thousands
# of lines of churn on every commit that touches it and risks a specifier
# desync against package.json. The lockfile is owned by pnpm — leave it alone.
pnpm-lock.yaml
